{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"rob-mac","name":"Rob Mac","birthDate":"1977-04-14","birthPlace":"Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, USA","bio":"Robert Dale \"Rob\" McElhenney (born April 14, 1977) is an American film and television actor best known for his role as Mac on the FX TV series It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia. He is also credited as creator, developer and executive producer of the show, which has also provided McElhenney with writing and directing credits on various episodes. He is married to Kaitlin Olson, who plays Deandra Reynolds on the show. He has also opened a bar in Philadelphia called Mac's Tavern.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Rob McElhenney, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:56:56+00:00","tmdbId":78597,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/78597","credits":[{"id":"deadpool-wolverine","title":"Deadpool & Wolverine","character":"TVA Soldier","characterFa":"سرباز TVA"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/rob-mac.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Big Phan","year":2026,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lpzLsGlIjmDUZTyFogDmXgPtHho.jpg"},{"name":"PaleyLive: It’s Always Sunny in Philadelphia 20th Anniversary Celebration!","year":2025,"character":"Self","mediaType":"movie","poster":""},{"name":"Side Quest","year":2025,"character":"Ian Grimm","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1DGS6UQ063QLAjLlBAvKY5GcsM4.jpg"},{"name":"Necaxa","year":2025,"character":"Self","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tKiQ7H60U8hLCzCBQpzbHGfFGTm.jpg"},{"name":"Deadpool & Wolverine","year":2024,"character":"TVA Soldier","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8cdWjvZQUExUUTzyp4t6EDMubfO.jpg","characterFa":"سرباز TVA"},{"name":"All Town Aren't We","year":2024,"character":"Self","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zp76m9I8GfDktG13ck4mQapMqDf.jpg"},{"name":"Hot O